{"id":"n24563-1-5","stage":1,"title":"일어서다 · 起身","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24563-1-5-1","ko":"요즘 자꾸 어지럼증이 느껴져요.","zh":"最近我总是感到头晕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"어지럼증이","meaning":"眩晕症","explanation":"어지럼증：眩晕症；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어지럼증","audio":"/audio/c2c0a134799ace01c382.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67087","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지럼증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어지럼증이","audio":"/audio/37dc8c00ab7fb2861b4c.mp3"}},{"text":"느껴져요.","meaning":"认为，觉得，感到；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"느끼다：认为，觉得，感到；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"4","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느껴져요","audio":"/audio/a600c1d394ba164da564.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"c2c0a134799ace01","term":"어지럼증","zh":"眩晕症","audio":"/audio/c2c0a134799ace01c382.mp3","entryId":"67087","definition":"精神恍惚，眼前发黑的症状。","pronunciation":["어지럼쯩"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"认为，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"感觉或认识到特定的对象或情况如何。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33851e2f8ef3c9b85c3d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24563-1-5-2","ko":"혹시 앉았다 일어설 때마다 그런가요?","zh":"是不是每次坐下又站起来的时候都会这样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"앉았다","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉았다","audio":"/audio/eac1a3b94bba3079efb3.mp3"}},{"text":"일어설","meaning":"起身，站起来","explanation":"일어서다：起身，站起来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"일어서다","audio":"/audio/af3b4b2f1fa55756e8eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24563","senseId":"1","lemma":"일어서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어설","audio":"/audio/1818e4c5e1f851f186d2.mp3"}},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때마다","audio":"/audio/1e35b901eccff392fa42.mp3"}},{"text":"그런가요